ection-BXMNB3IO.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>=
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-python">Input: matrix =3D [[<span class=
=3D"hljs-number">1</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>, <span clas=
s=3D"hljs-number">1</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">0</span>], [<span c=
